      <uighur>dörbelǰi</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дөрблөж(ин)</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DØRBELZI(N)</transcript>
      <definition>n. and adj. Square, rectangle; cube; square block; dice; diamonds (in cards); square felt cushion, square basket; square, rectangular, cubic.</definition>
